        <span class="au-tag">The Story</span>
        <h2>Nearly 20 years ago, Matt opened the first store with a simple idea.</h2>
        <p>Most people shopping for a massage chair were overwhelmed. The category was noisy — big brands, confusing specs, pushy salespeople, and prices that ranged from $500 to $15,000 with no clear reason why.</p>
        <p>Matt had been in the industry long enough to know one thing: the right chair for someone isn't the most expensive one. It's the one that fits their body, their space, and how they actually live. That insight became the foundation of Massage Chairs and More.</p>
        <p>Five showrooms later, across three malls and two decades, the approach hasn't changed much. Come in, try them side by side, and leave with a decision that feels calm — not pressured. We've helped thousands of customers through that moment. And we've learned that certainty, not inventory, is what people really come in looking for.</p>
