        <p style="color:#5c5c5c !important;font-size:16px !important;line-height:1.8 !important;margin-bottom:28px !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important">If a brand stops performing, it comes off the floor. If a new one proves itself, it earns a spot. It's not about carrying the most names — it's about standing behind every chair we sell.</p>
        <div style="padding:24px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;border-left:3px solid #b8944f">
