        <p style="color:#5c5c5c !important;font-size:16px !important;line-height:1.8 !important;margin-bottom:18px !important">California built this business. The specific stress of living here — the commutes, the desk tension, the pace — shaped how we listen and what we recommend. We understand it because we've been in the middle of it for twenty years.</p>
