<!-- PROMISE -->
<div style="padding:100px 0;border-top:1px solid #e5e0d8;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e0d8">
  <div style="max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 36px">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:start">
      <div>
        <span style="display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#b8944f;margin-bottom:20px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif">What We Won't Do</span>
        <h2 style="color:#111 !important;font-size:40px !important;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif !important;font-weight:700 !important;line-height:1.15 !important;font-style:italic !important;margin-bottom:28px !important;letter-spacing:-.02em">We'd rather lose a sale than lose your trust.</h2>
        <p style="color:#5c5c5c !important;font-size:17px !important;line-height:1.8 !important;margin-bottom:20px !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important">This isn't a tagline. It's a decision Matt made early on, and it shaped everything: how the stores are run, how the team is trained, what gets said on a slow Tuesday when no one's watching.</p>
        <p style="color:#5c5c5c !important;font-size:17px !important;line-height:1.8 !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important">The massage chair industry has plenty of noise. We decided a long time ago not to add to it.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0">
        <div style="padding:28px 0 28px 28px;border-left:3px solid #b8944f;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e0d8">
          <h4 style="color:#111 !important;font-size:16px !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important;font-weight:700 !important;margin-bottom:8px !important">No fake urgency</h4>
          <p style="color:#5c5c5c !important;font-size:14px !important;line-height:1.65 !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important">No countdown clocks, no "today only" pressure. If the chair is right for you, it'll still be right tomorrow.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:28px 0 28px 28px;border-left:3px solid #b8944f;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e0d8">
          <h4 style="color:#111 !important;font-size:16px !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important;font-weight:700 !important;margin-bottom:8px !important">No competitor trash talk</h4>
          <p style="color:#5c5c5c !important;font-size:14px !important;line-height:1.65 !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important">We don't win by making others look bad. We win by being genuinely useful — and letting you decide.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:28px 0 28px 28px;border-left:3px solid #b8944f;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e0d8">
          <h4 style="color:#111 !important;font-size:16px !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important;font-weight:700 !important;margin-bottom:8px !important">No sloppy explanations</h4>
          <p style="color:#5c5c5c !important;font-size:14px !important;line-height:1.65 !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important">If we can't explain why something matters to your specific situation, we don't say it.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:28px 0 28px 28px;border-left:3px solid #b8944f">
          <h4 style="color:#111 !important;font-size:16px !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important;font-weight:700 !important;margin-bottom:8px !important">No promises we can't keep</h4>
          <p style="color:#5c5c5c !important;font-size:14px !important;line-height:1.65 !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important">Massage has real benefits — relaxation, stress reduction, pain management. We talk about those. We don't promise miracles.</p>
