        <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif !important;font-size:20px !important;font-style:italic !important;color:#fff !important;line-height:1.65 !important;margin:0 0 16px !important">"This isn't about a miracle. It's about a routine you can return to — especially on the days you're running on empty. The chair that earns its spot is the one that asks nothing of you and still gives something back."</p>
        <span style="font-size:11px !important;font-weight:700 !important;color:#b8944f !important;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase">— Matt, Founder</span>
