<!-- HOW WE THINK ABOUT THE SALE -->
<section style="padding:100px 0;background:#fff">
  <div class="au-c">
    <div style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center" class="au-in">
      <span class="au-tag" style="margin-bottom:16px;display:block">The Sales Philosophy</span>
      <h2 style="font-size:40px !important;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-bottom:24px !important;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif !important;color:#111 !important;line-height:1.2 !important;font-weight:700 !important">We don't "handle" people. We take them seriously.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:18px !important;color:#5c5c5c !important;line-height:1.8 !important;margin:0 !important">There's a version of this business that would've been easier: high pressure, big incentives, close the deal and move on. We chose the other version. Slower, smaller margins on some sales, more conversations that don't end in a purchase. But people come back. And they send their friends.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:56px" class="au-in">
      <div style="background:#f8f6f3;border-radius:14px;padding:36px 28px">
        <div style="font-size:36px !important;font-weight:800 !important;color:#b8944f !important;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif !important;line-height:1 !important;margin-bottom:12px !important">01</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:17px !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important;font-weight:700 !important;color:#111 !important;margin-bottom:10px !important;line-height:1.3 !important">The first five minutes are just listening</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px !important;color:#5c5c5c !important;line-height:1.65 !important">Before we recommend anything, we want to understand what's actually going on — physically, practically, financially. That changes everything about what comes next.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#f8f6f3;border-radius:14px;padding:36px 28px">
        <div style="font-size:36px !important;font-weight:800 !important;color:#b8944f !important;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif !important;line-height:1 !important;margin-bottom:12px !important">02</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:17px !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important;font-weight:700 !important;color:#111 !important;margin-bottom:10px !important;line-height:1.3 !important">We'd rather say "not yet" than close too early</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px !important;color:#5c5c5c !important;line-height:1.65 !important">If someone isn't ready — financially or just emotionally — we say so. A sale that creates regret isn't a win for anyone. We'd rather they come back in six months ready than leave feeling pushed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#f8f6f3;border-radius:14px;padding:36px 28px">
        <div style="font-size:36px !important;font-weight:800 !important;color:#b8944f !important;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif !important;line-height:1 !important;margin-bottom:12px !important">03</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:17px !important;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif !important;font-weight:700 !important;color:#111 !important;margin-bottom:10px !important;line-height:1.3 !important">The relationship doesn't end at checkout</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px !important;color:#5c5c5c !important;line-height:1.65 !important">We follow up. We answer questions that come up two weeks later. We're the same people you talked to in the store — still reachable, still invested in whether you actually love the chair.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

