        <h2 style="font-size:40px !important;color:#fff !important;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-bottom:28px !important;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif !important;line-height:1.2 !important;font-weight:700 !important">Referrals and repeat customers are the only metric that matters to us.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:17px !important;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6) !important;line-height:1.8 !important;margin-bottom:20px !important">We've never spent much on advertising. Most of our business comes from people who came in, had a good experience, and told someone about it. That's the only kind of growth that compounds honestly.</p>
        <p style="font-size:17px !important;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6) !important;line-height:1.8 !important;margin-bottom:0 !important">When someone comes back three years later because they're buying a chair for a parent, or a friend walks in saying "my coworker said I had to come here" — that's the measure. Not the quarterly number. Not the conversion rate. The reason someone trusted us enough to attach their name to a recommendation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">
        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:14px;padding:32px 28px;margin-bottom:16px">
          <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif !important;font-size:18px !important;font-style:italic !important;color:#fff !important;line-height:1.65 !important;margin:0 0 14px !important">"When someone feels respected, their guard drops — and that's when the right decision becomes possible. Not before."</p>
          <span style="font-size:11px !important;font-weight:700 !important;color:#b8944f !important;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase">— Matt, Founder</span>
